        "title": "Another world",
        "text": "Best temple in kathmandu. A unesco world heritage site. They allow that you watch the cremation ceremony after the death of beloved ones of hindu community. It is in fact very sad to see that the people make their last duties to their beloved ones. I felt somehow guilty to watch them in atead of sharing the pain. But somehow it is a very different experience. All around the temple there are beautiful pagodas and on every corner there arr baba hindus which are considered as sacred.\nA must see place once arrived in kathmandu.",
